'''Boom Flies''' fly across the room in straight diagonal lines, dealing contact damage. Explodes upon death.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} While {{i|Skatole}} is held, the Boom Fly and all of its variants will fly significantly slower and will not deal contact damage, but their other means of attacking/dealing damage will still damage Isaac as normal.
* While Isaac has the [[Beelzebub]] transformation, all Boom Fly variants will become friendly, and will not damage Isaac by any means (including explosions).
{{clear}}

