== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|r}} The Boom Fly is tied with the {{e|Sucker}} for being the monster with the most true variants ('true variants' being monsters with ID x.1, x.2, etc), both with 7.
* {{dlc|r}} Both [[Anti:Dragonfly|Dragonfly]] types and the [[Anti:Sick Boom Fly|Sick Boom Fly]] first appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod. In ''Antibirth'', instead of having any stage hp they had 20 base hp.
** Sick Boomflies would only create poison gas on death and would not shoot out six tears when dying.

